        "note": "Export/import values are 1,000 MT (grain basis) from USDA FAS PSD for marketing year 2024/25. Russia leads world exports (~22% share); Egypt and Indonesia are the two largest importers (~12.5 Mt each). EU shown as a bloc; intra-EU trade excluded from the bloc figure."
