          "note": "One of the 'ABCD' majors. Large North American and Black Sea origination, milling and logistics footprint.",
          "improve": "ADM should break out wheat (vs. corn/soy) origination volumes by region and disclose Black Sea sourcing exposure, which is currently bundled inside Ag Services."
        },
        {
          "name": "Bunge Global (Bunge–Viterra)",
          "hq": "United States/Switzerland",
          "iso": "USA",
          "src": "bunge",
          "flag": "sourced",
          "metric": "Revenue ~US$53bn (Bunge FY2024); the ~US$34bn Bunge–Viterra merger completed July 2025 created a top-tier grain trader.",
          "sourcing": [
            "USA",
            "CAN",
            "ARG",
            "AUS",
            "UKR",
            "RUS",
            "FRA"
          ],
          "note": "Post-merger Bunge-Viterra is one of the largest global grain handlers, with deep Canadian (Viterra Prairie elevators), Australian and Black Sea origination added to Bunge's Americas base.",
          "improve": "Integration of Viterra's Canadian/Australian assets concentrates a large share of Prairie and Black Sea wheat handling in one firm; transparent post-merger origin-share reporting would address competition and concentration concerns."
        },
        {
          "name": "Louis Dreyfus Company (LDC)",
          "hq": "Netherlands/France",
          "iso": "NLD",
          "src": "ldc",
          "flag": "sourced",
          "metric": "Revenue ~US$50bn (FY2024); the 'D' in ABCD, with a Grains & Oilseeds platform.",
          "sourcing": [
