          "flag": "modeled",
          "metric": "One of Pakistan's largest rice exporters (basmati + non-basmati); ships to the Gulf, EU, Africa and SE Asia.",
          "sourcing": [
            "PAK"
          ],
          "note": "Representative of the Pakistani exporter cluster (REAP members) that captured India-gap demand in 2023-24. Volume figures are not publicly audited — flagged modeled.",
          "improve": "Pakistani exporters as a group lack audited public volumes; a sourced REAP member-level disclosure would let analysts quantify Pakistan's swing-supplier role."
