          "note": "Strong corn origination in Argentina and the Black Sea plus North American grain assets; the Bunge merger reshapes the competitive map.",
          "improve": "Through the Bunge combination, Viterra's corn assets concentrate further. Clear pre/post-merger disclosure of corn origination by country and of how overlapping Argentine/Black Sea positions are managed would address concentration and antitrust scrutiny."
        }
