          "note": "China bought ~22-27 Mt of US beans in 2024 (~half of US exports); a tariff/retaliation freeze (as seen late-2025) redirects US beans to the EU/Mexico/SE Asia at a discount and hands China share to Brazil. Models a ~50% hit to US export demand.",
          "src": "ussec"
